// pfodWeb NOTE: per-board override — this is the Waveshare
// ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-1.69. Removed from the chip-level default
// chipGpios map:
//  4,5,6,7,8,15   onboard ST7789V2 display (DC/CS/SCL/SDA/RST/BL)
//  10,11,13,14    onboard CST816T touch controller's I2C+RST+INT
//  38,41          onboard QMI8658 IMU / PCF85063 RTC interrupts
//  33,35,36       onboard buzzer + system enable/out (vendor's own
//                 "GPIO and PSRAM conflict" caution)
// Kept: GPIO1 (BAT_ADC, a battery-monitor sensor reading), GPIO2/3/
// 17/18 (not dedicated on this specific display model, unlike
// sibling boards), GPIO34/37 (SS/MISO), and TX/RX (43,44).
// Full copy of variants/esp32/esp32s3/board.json otherwise.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO0 tagged "button" - confirmed onboard BOOT/Key1
// pushbutton (docs.waveshare.com/ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-1.69 Onboard
// Resources/GPIO Allocation: "GPIO0 is the BOOT pin", "Key1 / BOOT",
// "hold while powering on, then release to enter download mode").
{
  "boardName": "ESP32S3",
  "displayName": "ESP32-S3 Dev Module",
  "family": "esp32",
